TI  - Opening the black box: why do euploid blastocysts fail to implant? A systematic review and meta-analysis
AU  - Danilo Cimadomo
AU  - Laura Rienzi
AU  - Alessandro Conforti
AU  - Eric J. Forman
AU  - Stefano Canosa
AU  - Federica Innocenti
